Commands should: mutate state, return void or just an ID/acknowledgment.
Queries should: return data, have NO side effects (no DB writes, no state mutation).
Violations: Save() that returns the full entity graph, Get() that increments a counter,
Process() that both modifies and returns business data.

Return [] if no violations. Return ONLY the JSON array.
